Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:35:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop): sort sidebar projects alphabetically and hide
 empty ones [daveey]

Fork policy (sidebarProjectPolicy in project-filter.ts):
- Overview projects sort by name (numeric, case-insensitive); Home stays first.
  Activity order, active-project hoist and saved drag order no longer apply,
  so the drag handle is dropped.
- Projects with no sessions are hidden, explicit ones included. Home and the
  currently entered project always stay (entering a fresh empty project must
  not bounce back to the overview).

Proof: new model/project-filter/integration tests fail on the old source
(4 red) and pass with it; sidebar vitest 529/529, tsc, eslint, health clean.
